1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Road damage detection: released YOLOv8n weights and real road images.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:18,000
A real HTTP request returns detections, coordinates and confidence scores.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:30,000
An annotated crack is missed. No detections does not mean no damage.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The published D20 reference is not recovered by the D00 prediction.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
PyTorch and ONNX agree within explicit tolerances on scoped fixtures.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Historical CPU throughput and validation accuracy measure different things.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Inspect the evidence, reproduce the run and explore the API on GitHub.
